{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8c0d6006945d280a3fa","chatId":"46b44a9ab26841f09d5ba2f7a733411a","sessionId":null,"userId":68656,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":722,"promptTokens":1477,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:08"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007573573254998166,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8c0d6006945d280a3f9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369728759,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8c0d6006945d280a3f9","chatId":"46b44a9ab26841f09d5ba2f7a733411a","sessionId":null,"userId":68656,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小萨和艾米决定一起去印度餐厅吃晚饭。艾米是美国人，从来没吃过印餐。他们来了这个餐厅因为小萨希望艾米尝试她的文化和食物。 餐品一上，小萨就开始用手吃饭，并且谈起这顿饭如何让她想起来妈妈做的饭菜。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小萨最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 开心\nB) 尴尬\nC) 紧张\nD) 自豪\nE) 反感\nF) 反对\n\n## 问题 2\n小萨为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她喜欢这些食物，因为它让她想起了她妈妈做的菜\nB) 她正在向艾米介绍她的文化\nC) 小萨喜欢餐厅的气氛\nD) 小萨想念她的母亲","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007573573254998166,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8c0d6006945d280a3fa","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369728756,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"afbbf5d57dec489d98cb6aa4a073ca7c"}